      "instance_name": "religious_intolerance",
      "label": "Religious Intolerance",
      "description": "The meme frames criticism of Buddhism as an affront to a 'peaceful religion,' invoking a sense of moral outrage and implying that dissent is unacceptable or blasphemous. This reflects a broader real-world phenomenon of religious intolerance, where criticism of religious beliefs or practices is met with hostility or attempts to delegitimize dissent.",
