      "instance_name": "anti_buddhist_sentiment",
      "label": "Anti-Buddhist Sentiment",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the existence of anti-Buddhist sentiment in society, where Buddhists may be targeted or mocked for their beliefs. This sentiment is often rooted in cultural misunderstandings, stereotypes, or prejudice against Eastern religions in Western contexts.",
