      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "religious_defensiveness",
      "label": "Religious Defensiveness",
      "description": "The meme exemplifies religious defensiveness — the tendency to react with anger or offense to criticism of one's faith, often by portraying the religion as sacred and inviolable. This is a common response in some religious communities when faced with questioning or satire.",
